WEBVTT

1
00:59:54.274 --> 00:59:56.274
What a wonderful day it is today.

2
00:59:58.274 --> 01:00:03.274
And what's so nice is that in one week the summer camps will start.

3
01:00:07.274 --> 01:00:12.274
First four days of children's camp and then four days of youth camp.

4
01:00:13.274 --> 01:00:16.274
And I have two things to ask for that.

5
01:00:17.274 --> 01:00:24.274
The first is, we still need two night watchmen on Wednesday evening.

6
01:00:25.274 --> 01:00:26.274
Cindy, could you please stand up for a moment?

7
01:00:27.274 --> 01:00:31.274
We find it very important that our young people and our children are safe.

8
01:00:33.274 --> 01:00:40.274
And of course the supplies, the materials, that no one goes into the camp, and no one goes out of the camp either.

9
01:00:41.274 --> 01:00:47.274
If you want to be a night watchman on Wednesday evening with someone else, please sign up with Cindy.

10
01:00:48.274 --> 01:00:52.274
We don't have anyone for that yet, so please.

11
01:00:53.274 --> 01:01:01.274
The other thing I want to ask is, the collection today specifically goes to the camps.

12
01:01:02.274 --> 01:01:09.274
And it is very important to put our shoulders together to carry this together.

13
01:01:10.274 --> 01:01:15.274
Maybe you don't have children, maybe the children have already left home, it can all be.

14
01:01:16.274 --> 01:01:24.274
But we are one household together, and so we share the responsibility for all our children and young people.

15
01:01:25.274 --> 01:01:27.274
Let's see what Deuteronomy says about that.

16
01:01:32.274 --> 01:01:34.274
This is my favorite verse.

17
01:01:35.274 --> 01:01:39.274
Love Him with all your heart, all your soul, and all that you have.

18
01:01:40.274 --> 01:01:45.274
That is actually summarized very briefly as the most important commandment.

19
01:01:46.274 --> 01:01:47.274
But there is more written.

20
01:01:48.274 --> 01:01:50.274
Keep in your heart what I teach you today.

21
01:01:52.274 --> 01:01:55.274
Teach it to your children or your young people.

22
01:01:56.274 --> 01:01:59.274
Talk to them about it when you are on camp.

23
01:01:59.274 --> 01:02:01.274
When you are on the road.

24
01:02:02.274 --> 01:02:04.274
When you get up and when you go to bed.

25
01:02:06.274 --> 01:02:08.274
This is of course a command to parents.

26
01:02:09.274 --> 01:02:11.274
Or to uncles and aunts or grandfathers and grandmothers.

27
01:02:12.274 --> 01:02:15.274
They say sometimes, you need a village to raise a kid.

28
01:02:16.274 --> 01:02:19.274
In other words, you need a whole village to raise your child.

29
01:02:20.274 --> 01:02:23.274
You need your family and your friends, but you also need the church.

30
01:02:24.274 --> 01:02:32.274
Together we want to put our shoulders under it to give them a fantastic week.

31
01:02:33.274 --> 01:02:35.274
What is the collection specifically for?

32
01:02:36.274 --> 01:02:37.274
There are three things.

33
01:02:38.274 --> 01:02:40.274
First of all, the leaders who are going along.

34
01:02:41.274 --> 01:02:44.274
There are twenty for the children's camp.

35
01:02:48.274 --> 01:02:50.274
And eleven leaders for the youth camp.

36
01:02:53.274 --> 01:02:54.274
Great.

37
01:02:55.274 --> 01:02:57.274
These people take their vacation days.

38
01:02:58.274 --> 01:03:00.274
They set aside their time.

39
01:03:01.274 --> 01:03:05.274
And so we believe that they should not have to pay for their own expenses as well.

40
01:03:06.274 --> 01:03:08.274
That is why we are also holding a collection.

41
01:03:09.274 --> 01:03:13.274
So that they are released to serve in these camps in any case.

42
01:03:14.274 --> 01:03:15.274
That is the first.

43
01:03:16.274 --> 01:03:20.274
The second is that we also take care as a church for the location.

44
01:03:20.274 --> 01:03:27.274
So the location and the tent and the materials that are rented, we share that responsibility together.

45
01:03:28.274 --> 01:03:36.274
So that the children and the young people have a nice place to sleep and a good place to be.

46
01:03:37.274 --> 01:03:46.274
And finally, we have a support for families who are having a harder time and who could use that support.

47
01:03:46.274 --> 01:03:53.274
And all these things together, for that we want to collect, let me just say, a big fat collection.

48
01:03:54.274 --> 01:04:01.274
Usually we don't say it like that, but it is so important to put our shoulders under this.

49
01:04:02.274 --> 01:04:11.274
I want to say, if you are a guest here, if you are on vacation here or if you are here for the first time, feel free to let it pass you by.

50
01:04:11.274 --> 01:04:23.274
You are of course welcome to participate, but let us as a church family, as a family together, put our shoulders under it, so that this will be a fantastic week.

51
01:04:24.274 --> 01:04:31.274
And don't forget to pray. So next week the preparations are taking place, Saturday the setup already begins.

52
01:04:32.274 --> 01:04:39.274
The weather will be fantastically nice and we really want to hear a fantastic testimony afterwards together.

53
01:04:39.274 --> 01:04:41.274
Amen? Amen.

54
01:04:43.274 --> 01:04:48.274
Tim, shall we give him a welcome home applause again?

55
01:04:53.274 --> 01:04:58.274
Thank you. Hallelujah. Is everyone doing well?

56
01:04:59.274 --> 01:05:05.274
Good, good, good. Grab your Bible, people, we are going to have a good Bible study.

57
01:05:05.274 --> 01:05:07.274
A spirit Bible study.

58
01:05:08.274 --> 01:05:12.274
There is a lot of text, we are going to go through it.

59
01:05:13.274 --> 01:05:23.274
But I also want to give an update on what you have experienced, what we have experienced in the past month while we have been away.

60
01:05:24.274 --> 01:05:31.274
God always speaks, did you know that? God is not someone who only speaks on Sunday mornings.

61
01:05:31.274 --> 01:05:38.274
God who speaks also during your dreams. God who speaks also during your vacation.

62
01:05:39.274 --> 01:05:46.274
God who speaks also through people. God who speaks also through your prayers when you are not in church; you should always pray there as well.

63
01:05:47.274 --> 01:05:54.274
God who speaks also through His Word when we are not in church. Read your Bible, pray every day if you want to grow. Amen?

64
01:05:55.274 --> 01:06:05.274
And so God is always communicating with His people. The question is, how much do we receive of His calling voice?

65
01:06:06.274 --> 01:06:17.274
I believe that God is always sending signals 24/7. However, I think unfortunately that we miss a few signals.

66
01:06:17.274 --> 01:06:26.274
And so it is up to us, driven by the Holy Spirit, to stay as focused as possible on Jesus Christ.

67
01:06:27.274 --> 01:06:32.274
So that we can be an open channel through which He can speak to us. Amen? Hallelujah.

68
01:06:33.274 --> 01:06:43.274
And so in the past month, Vanessa and I visited Vanessa's mother in Australia. It was a very nice time.

69
01:06:43.274 --> 01:06:51.274
But I don't know if you can remember, before I went on vacation, I think it was my last teaching or maybe the week before that.

70
01:06:52.274 --> 01:07:00.274
Then I said that I am busy or I feel that God is working in me to give a certain message, a certain teaching.

71
01:07:01.274 --> 01:07:09.274
And it is about three important words. And I would like to see them on the screen, Michael. Then we can name them out loud.

72
01:07:09.274 --> 01:07:12.274
I will start with the English version. Let's take a look.

73
01:07:13.274 --> 01:07:19.274
Sanctification, purification, and consecration. Shall we say those three words? Sanctification, say it.

74
01:07:20.274 --> 01:07:25.274
Sanctification. Then we say purification and consecration.

75
01:07:26.274 --> 01:07:33.274
Alright, good. Shall we do that one more time? Sanctification, purification, and consecration.

76
01:07:34.274 --> 01:07:42.274
And those words have been going through me. And not just in the last few weeks or months, but actually for a few years now.

77
01:07:43.274 --> 01:07:50.274
If you have been somewhat involved with this church family, then you know that we have been quite busy with this in the last few years.

78
01:07:51.274 --> 01:07:59.274
A few years ago, I communicated quite strongly that I feel the Spirit of God is cleansing His church.

79
01:08:00.274 --> 01:08:05.274
Do you remember that? It was a few years ago and it weighed heavily on my heart.

80
01:08:06.274 --> 01:08:09.274
I believe that Jesus Christ is coming back. Does anyone believe that?

81
01:08:10.274 --> 01:08:14.274
And I will not say what date he will return, because the Bible says that we do not know the date.

82
01:08:15.274 --> 01:08:20.274
And every person who says that they do know when he will return is lying, because that is literally stated in the Bible.

83
01:08:21.274 --> 01:08:27.274
We do not know the date, but we can recognize from the signs of the times that it will not be long now.

84
01:08:27.274 --> 01:08:37.274
And here is something funny, he will return sooner than in the time when Paul wrote it, and Paul said that he looked forward to the time when he would return.

85
01:08:38.274 --> 01:08:43.274
And so now we live closer to the time when he will return.

86
01:08:44.274 --> 01:08:52.274
I do not know if it will take weeks, I do not know if it will take months, years, decades, or maybe even hundreds of years or perhaps thousands of years.

87
01:08:53.274 --> 01:08:55.274
I do not think it will take thousands of years.

88
01:08:55.274 --> 01:09:04.274
I think if we continue like this, if the world goes on like this much longer, you will get a terminator effect, it will be over.

89
01:09:05.274 --> 01:09:13.274
And that is not to speak fatalistically, but if you look around you in the world, you see that the complexity of this world,

90
01:09:14.274 --> 01:09:20.274
I believe that only through Jesus can restoration come to this earth, to him be the glory and the honor,

91
01:09:20.274 --> 01:09:26.274
he is the Prince of Peace and when he returns he will create a new earth and a new heaven. Amen?

92
01:09:27.274 --> 01:09:28.274
Hallelujah.

93
01:09:29.274 --> 01:09:38.274
And so I think that Jesus might return in our lives, in our generation, Maranatha, please come back Jesus.

94
01:09:39.274 --> 01:09:41.274
But maybe it will also take a number of generations.

95
01:09:42.274 --> 01:09:50.274
And because it may still take a long time, it is important that your and my faith experiences perseverance.

96
01:09:51.274 --> 01:09:56.274
Perseverance means that we continue in our faith. That we do not stop believing.

97
01:09:57.274 --> 01:10:02.274
That we were once baptized, that we once had a great time in the church, that there was once a hype,

98
01:10:03.274 --> 01:10:06.274
that we can once say that we experienced a revival in our hearts,

99
01:10:06.274 --> 01:10:12.274
but at some point in a certain year there was disappointment, or there was temptation,

100
01:10:13.274 --> 01:10:16.274
or there was a habit, or boredom in faith came.

101
01:10:17.274 --> 01:10:22.274
And eventually we thought, you know what? Ah, and it weakens.

102
01:10:23.274 --> 01:10:30.274
Unfortunately, I am 43 years old, unfortunately I have seen a lot of Christianity in my life.

103
01:10:30.274 --> 01:10:39.274
I am a son of a pastor, a church planter, and I have experienced a lot of winds in faith throughout my life.

104
01:10:40.274 --> 01:10:43.274
I have seen all sorts of things. I have visited many churches together with my parents.

105
01:10:44.274 --> 01:10:47.274
I have seen various movements in my life.

106
01:10:48.274 --> 01:10:53.274
And I have seen how many things start and how often flames go out, and that is a shame.

107
01:10:53.274 --> 01:10:59.274
And here is a statement I want to make with authority and faith and hope and gratitude towards Jesus.

108
01:11:00.274 --> 01:11:06.274
But this church will exist when Jesus returns. This church will exist when Jesus returns.

109
01:11:07.274 --> 01:11:13.274
And why do I say this? Because it is important that there is a tribe, that there is a tribe of believers,

110
01:11:14.274 --> 01:11:19.274
to stand for Jesus when he returns to this earth, when we will see him face-to-face,

111
01:11:19.274 --> 01:11:23.274
that we can say, open church crowd, and that is not to be arrogant,

112
01:11:24.274 --> 01:11:28.274
but that we can say, here we are. We have finished our race.

113
01:11:29.274 --> 01:11:33.274
As Paul also said, I run my race to finish the race.

114
01:11:34.274 --> 01:11:38.274
Which crazy person starts a marathon only to stop a hundred meters later?

115
01:11:39.274 --> 01:11:46.274
You start something to finish something. You start a house to finish a house.

116
01:11:46.274 --> 01:11:53.274
You start a fight to win a fight. You start a competition to win a competition. Amen?

117
01:11:54.274 --> 01:12:00.274
Hallelujah. And so, sanctification, purification, and consecration.

118
01:12:01.274 --> 01:12:08.274
I feel that in the past few years we have been quite busy in open church with purification.

119
01:12:08.274 --> 01:12:15.274
I feel that certain matters in the church of Jesus Christ needed to be set right.

120
01:12:16.274 --> 01:12:19.274
Is that correct Dutch that needed to be? Yes, strange language, right.

121
01:12:21.274 --> 01:12:25.274
Let's take a look at the Dutch translation. I have written them down as well.

122
01:12:26.274 --> 01:12:29.274
Here they are. Cleansing, sanctification, and dedication. Shall we say that one more time?

123
01:12:30.274 --> 01:12:36.274
Cleansing, sanctification, and dedication. Cleansing, sanctification, and dedication.

124
01:12:36.274 --> 01:12:37.274
Sanctification and dedication.

125
01:12:38.274 --> 01:12:42.274
My mistake. I see I made an error. Because actually, I should have reversed them.

126
01:12:43.274 --> 01:12:48.274
It is sanctification, but that was a test. That was a test to see if you were awake. Amen?

127
01:12:49.274 --> 01:12:55.274
Good. It is actually sanctification, cleansing, and dedication. But yes, I do that when I rush and push something through.

128
01:12:56.274 --> 01:13:00.274
It is sanctification, cleansing, dedication.

129
01:13:00.274 --> 01:13:14.274
Sanctification is when you look to Jesus and what he has done for you. The blood of Jesus has saved you.

130
01:13:15.274 --> 01:13:25.274
And salvation means that you are sanctified from death, from your previous life.

131
01:13:25.274 --> 01:13:32.274
Holy means to be set apart. So that you are taken from your death by Jesus.

132
01:13:33.274 --> 01:13:38.274
Through the blood of Jesus, you are washed clean. Your sins are taken away from you.

133
01:13:39.274 --> 01:13:46.274
As soon as you accept Jesus, you are a new creation. The old has passed away, the new has come.

134
01:13:47.274 --> 01:13:52.274
And that sanctification, you cannot add anything to it.

135
01:13:53.274 --> 01:13:58.274
So you cannot say, Jesus has saved me for 50%.

136
01:13:59.274 --> 01:14:07.274
And with that 50%, I still have to do all sorts of things to complete my salvation, my sanctification, my redemption.

137
01:14:08.274 --> 01:14:13.274
Your good works add nothing to the cross of Golgotha. Can I get an amen on that?

138
01:14:13.274 --> 01:14:16.274
Because we need to be very strict about this.

139
01:14:17.274 --> 01:14:30.274
Not 50%, not 75%, not 99.9%, 100% of the work of Jesus Christ has been sufficient for a new heaven and a new earth and for your salvation.

140
01:14:31.274 --> 01:14:35.274
All glory to King Jesus. Shall we give him a round of applause? All glory.

141
01:14:36.274 --> 01:14:40.274
Let it be clear what I will teach in the coming time.

142
01:14:41.274 --> 01:14:46.274
Let it be clear that I am not saying, nice what Jesus has done, but we must also do this and that.

143
01:14:47.274 --> 01:14:56.274
I will take us on a journey where Jesus is both sanctification and purification and consecration all-encompassing.

144
01:14:57.274 --> 01:14:59.274
Sorry for the English word, but all-encompassing.

145
01:15:00.274 --> 01:15:02.274
Jesus is all of this.

146
01:15:02.274 --> 01:15:04.274
Jesus is sanctification.

147
01:15:05.274 --> 01:15:07.274
Jesus is purification.

148
01:15:08.274 --> 01:15:09.274
Jesus is consecration.

149
01:15:10.274 --> 01:15:14.274
If anyone was devoted, it was the Son of God.

150
01:15:15.274 --> 01:15:25.274
If anyone was devoted, he looked with disdain at the cross because he knew what was to be gained after the cross, namely your and my soul.

151
01:15:26.274 --> 01:15:28.274
He looked with disdain, says the Hebrew letter.

152
01:15:28.274 --> 01:15:31.274
He looked with disdain, says the Hebrew letter.

153
01:15:32.274 --> 01:15:38.274
In other words, he scorned the cross because he knew he could win you.

154
01:15:39.274 --> 01:15:40.274
Hallelujah, praise the Lord.

155
01:15:41.274 --> 01:15:46.274
And so sanctification, therefore, we have nothing to add to that.

156
01:15:47.274 --> 01:15:50.274
The only thing we must do is naturally accept that.

157
01:15:51.274 --> 01:15:56.274
If I have a gift for you, then you don't have to do anything for it.

158
01:15:56.274 --> 01:16:01.274
I went to the store, I bought that for you, I worked for it, I paid for it.

159
01:16:02.274 --> 01:16:05.274
The only thing I do is during that party say, here you go, here is a gift.

160
01:16:06.274 --> 01:16:08.274
The only thing you have to do is accept that gift.

161
01:16:09.274 --> 01:16:13.274
This, it can't be that difficult, it seems to me.

162
01:16:14.274 --> 01:16:18.274
But if you then say no, I don't want that gift, then that's fair enough, you won't receive the gift.

163
01:16:19.274 --> 01:16:25.274
And so the only thing Jesus has done, the Bible also clearly states that Jesus has been given to us.

164
01:16:26.274 --> 01:16:30.274
A child is born to us, he is given to us.

165
01:16:31.274 --> 01:16:36.274
And so we must accept Jesus if we want to enter into that sanctification of Jesus.

166
01:16:37.274 --> 01:16:38.274
Hallelujah.

167
01:16:41.274 --> 01:16:50.274
And in the last few years, I have simply seen, also regarding the status of the global church.

168
01:16:51.274 --> 01:16:55.274
And then I mainly want to talk about the Protestant evangelical church.

169
01:16:56.274 --> 01:17:02.274
Because if we somewhat identify ourselves with that group of people.

170
01:17:04.274 --> 01:17:11.274
Then I must say, and I have also been involved there, with large movements and large churches.

171
01:17:12.274 --> 01:17:14.274
And doing things in the churches, and it's wonderful.

172
01:17:15.274 --> 01:17:17.274
And because of that we have been told, and I don't want to throw mud at the past.

173
01:17:18.274 --> 01:17:23.274
Because if you condemn the past, then you must also be careful that you don't stumble yourself.

174
01:17:24.274 --> 01:17:26.274
With your big arrogant mouth. I understand how that works.

175
01:17:27.274 --> 01:17:34.274
But one of the things that weighs heavily on me and has been placed on the church, I feel.

176
01:17:35.274 --> 01:17:39.274
Is that we have had to be serious about the cleansing of the church in the past few years.

177
01:17:40.274 --> 01:17:45.274
And that we must start living according to the norms and values of the Bible, namely according to God's Word.

178
01:17:45.274 --> 01:17:50.274
For Jesus says, not only the people who hear what I have said are my children.

179
01:17:51.274 --> 01:17:53.274
But all people who... do!

180
01:17:54.274 --> 01:17:59.274
Who said that loudly? Kitty, I love you. Good to see you back. I missed you.

181
01:18:00.274 --> 01:18:04.274
Not only when you hear... there were so many people.

182
01:18:05.274 --> 01:18:08.274
There were so many people who heard the Sermon on the Mount from Jesus.

183
01:18:09.274 --> 01:18:11.274
But not everyone followed Jesus.

184
01:18:11.274 --> 01:18:16.274
In fact, when Jesus stood before Pilate, the crowd shouted crucify him.

185
01:18:17.274 --> 01:18:23.274
So hearing the words of Jesus, with love and respect for the beautiful words of Jesus,

186
01:18:24.274 --> 01:18:28.274
hearing the words of Jesus does not make you saved.

187
01:18:29.274 --> 01:18:32.274
You must also accept them in your life. You must also embrace them.

188
01:18:33.274 --> 01:18:36.274
And how do you accept them? And here comes the teaching I want to give you.

189
01:18:36.274 --> 01:18:59.274
In the Old Testament, it was very clear and labor-intensive and sacrificial to be right with Jehovah.

190
01:19:00.274 --> 01:19:07.274
In the Old Testament, if you had done something wrong, the consequence of a certain sin was very severe.

191
01:19:08.274 --> 01:19:16.274
This. I have been on vacation and so I took my Sabbath time very seriously.

192
01:19:17.274 --> 01:19:24.274
In the Old Testament, if you did not take your rest seriously, you would pay for it.

193
01:19:25.274 --> 01:19:27.274
You could be stoned. You would just pay for it.

194
01:19:27.274 --> 01:19:31.274
So important were the laws of Moses in the Old Testament.

195
01:19:32.274 --> 01:19:36.274
And at one point, for example, I will give you an example from the Bible,

196
01:19:37.274 --> 01:19:46.274
the people of God, who at one point said to Moses, out of perhaps a bit of curiosity, perhaps jealousy towards Moses, perhaps also a real desire,

197
01:19:47.274 --> 01:19:51.274
but they said to Moses, yes but we also want to meet God on the mountain.

198
01:19:52.274 --> 01:19:57.274
And Moses said, yes that's good, I think that's great if we can set up this meeting.

199
01:19:58.274 --> 01:20:03.274
You know what, I will go to God on the mountain and I will discuss with him that the people also want to have a meeting.

200
01:20:04.274 --> 01:20:05.274
Really a face-to-face meeting.

201
01:20:06.274 --> 01:20:11.274
Look, normally Moses came down from a mountain with stone tablets, you know, once smashed, then new ones.

202
01:20:12.274 --> 01:20:16.274
You know how that went? Normally Moses came down from the mountain with the revelation of God.

203
01:20:17.274 --> 01:20:18.274
But now the people of God said, but we want that too.

204
01:20:18.274 --> 01:20:22.274
And do you know what God said to Moses then?

205
01:20:23.274 --> 01:20:26.274
Okay, we will do that, but do you know what you need to do?

206
01:20:27.274 --> 01:20:39.274
Then you had to prepare yourself in a sanctification and purification ritual, if you wanted to come into the presence of God.

207
01:20:40.274 --> 01:20:41.274
